# StandardError => e` -- `#error unhandled opcode RESCUE`/`RAISEIF`/
# `EXCEPT`. compile_method emits or drops a method's ENTIRE body as one
# unit (SKIP_UNSUPPORTED's own real mechanism: a method whose generated
